# an aspect recovers its own error: the primary aspect never sees it
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#errors-across-apply
primary aspect b16_aspect_recover is
  process main is
    apply safe();
    print "driver goes on";
  recover
    print "driver recover: never";
  return;
end b16_aspect_recover;
